[{"title":"送喻汤佐由试佥事降文昌县主簿","author":"谢肃","text":"文昌主簿新纡宠，平乐分司旧拜恩。\n獬豸高峨冠上角，凤皇深护棘中身。\n问津海涌琼崖晓，辞阙天回紫极春。\n自古功名归秀士，好将惠泽溥黎民。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":379,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送朱止善知福州府","author":"谢肃","text":"圣主御天图盛治，侍臣荐剡及遗材。\n殿廷晓奉月符出，闽海春迎五马来。\n到郡应脩使君闸，过家还上越王台。\n共传富贵如翁子，半百声名动上台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":380,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南宫县花园","author":"王以悟","text":"晴空客署映秋塘，古树名花叶半黄。\n人入洞□疑市远，林经霜后觉衣凉。\n归鸦落日曦光淡，篱菊回风晚韵香。\n奔走年□嗟往事，月寮惺枕一匡床。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":381,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日上大名饮肥乡道中","author":"王以悟","text":"一官三载那闲刻，此日却同方外人。\n宛转溪村疑故里，青黄云树似初春。\n遥闻春杵逄逄遍，入眼裘裳处处新。\n念我薄游值岁稔，停骖沽酒莫嫌频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":382,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"久旱秋尽雨后憩柴家庄","author":"王以悟","text":"晴原夕照到孤庄，落木萧条堪断肠。\n瓮底空留麦种在，河桥昨夜巳浮霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":383,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送喻士文之柳州马田县丞","author":"谢肃","text":"丹符佐邑龙城去，金阙曾为论治人。\n解听萧韶知圣德，好将冠冕化文身。\n公庭榕叶莺声巧，江水杨花鹢首新。\n公退从容询往事，罗池碑刻涴苔痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":384,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武夷山","author":"谢肃","text":"南下闽关纡使节，武夷幽事忽相牵。\n几重山翠啼猿外，九曲溪流钓艇前。\n俯仰此身惊宠锡，飞行何地觅神仙。\n玄都熟煮金芽饮，注目豪鹰捩海天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":385,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大王峰","author":"谢肃","text":"大王峰起压群山，想像临朝碧汉间。\n城郭楼台馀刻画，烟霞猿鸟足高闲。\n正思问俗纡鞍马，难逐飞仙振佩环。\n九曲棹歌聊自唱，天风音节动闽关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":386,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天风海涛亭三首 其一","author":"谢肃","text":"全闽乔岳此第一，谁作孤亭俯八垓。\n风自天东吹日出，涛从海上挟云来。\n振衣千仞知犹健，持节重临愧不才。\n回望帝京当北极，紫金佳气护蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":387,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天风海涛亭三首 其二","author":"谢肃","text":"天风亭榭玉芙蓉，临眺令人忆玩翁。\n万里乾坤春浩浩，八方川岳日融融。\n为寻陈迹纡骢马，错料深渊蛰应龙。\n佛国有珠悬白月，光华无处不圆通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":388,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天风海涛亭三首 其三","author":"谢肃","text":"风涛亭下万山低，度壑缘厓信杖䉫。\n杜若波澄池凤浴，桄榔月皎峡猿啼。\n灵源有物云应护，大顶通霄路不迷。\n谁颂观音初出世，铿锵钟鼓石门西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":389,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淡青","author":"明声","text":"淡青生来牙要红，头麻项阔翅玲珑。\n更生肉肚如雪白，赢尽秋虫独奏功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":390,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"深黄","author":"明哑","text":"黄者生来金箔黄，腿脚班黄腰■长。\n若生一付乌牙齿，三秋饶大莫商量。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":391,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌青","author":"明象","text":"乌青生来似定墨，腿脚班狸肉带黑。\n钳若细长似血红，合战交锋如霹雳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":392,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红黄","author":"明令","text":"头似珊瑚项班红，翅如金箔肉带黄。\n腿脚■长如玉色，秋虫见了自慌张。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":393,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虾青","author":"明白","text":"麻头青项翅如金，肉腿生来白似银。\n钳更细长苏木色，此虫名号是虾青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":394,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淡白","author":"明乐","text":"白头白项翅铺银，入手观来却似冰。\n此虫异众称奇白，总无颜色是将军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":395,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淡紫","author":"明净","text":"名为淡紫遍身明，项如青靛齿紫红。\n头上三尖腰要阔，战得场中不敢逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":396,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫青","author":"明安","text":"琥珀头尖项紫青，翅如苏叶肉还青。\n天生一付牙红紫，交锋一口立黄金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":397,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黑青","author":"明印","text":"黑者须当黑似漆，仔细看来无别色。\n更兼牙肚白如银，名号将军为第一。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":398,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壶公山怀舍侄惟升","author":"谢肃","text":"骢马西临莆口大，一山千仞卓崔嵬。\n泉当绝顶通朝夕，日转壶中照殿台。\n弭节偶然观海去，省风宁为觅仙来。\n还怜须鬓都成雪，家侄何时共酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":399,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日宪?言怀","author":"谢肃","text":"迎得春还献岁前，风光浮动七闽天。\n岂无盘送青丝菜，况有琴弹白雪萹。\n纪省斗鸡须守气，南华养虎在行权。\n大钧生意何曾断，海柳江梅各自妍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":400,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宪?言怀","author":"谢肃","text":"乐圃中间开宪府，东头池阁足逍遥。\n水栏浸月鱼游缓，云栱凌空燕语娇。\n用法倘乖钦恤意，居官何补圣明朝。\n却惭才薄虚縻禄，唯待秋风旧皂雕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":401,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月二十五日按察使陶垕仲佥事谢肃为纠劾左布政薛大昉贪淫䓁事既奏准令按察司就行取问彼亦造谤还词有旨都提取赴京于都察院听对肃与垕仲将出福州城城中老稚莫不哭送诗以纪之","author":"谢肃","text":"几行飞奏九重书，一使追回万里涂。\n炎热可能捐素扇，清冰元自贮寒壶。\n气随虹蜺横南极，梦挟风云入上都。\n照见忠邪皇鉴在，尔民何用哭行车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":402,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七月十五夜太湖看月","author":"谢肃","text":"震泽早秋秋月明，老夫此夜颇关情。\n三千馀里出闽海，七十二峰看洞庭。\n滉漾金波浮大地，淋漓元气湿青冥。\n茫然错料鸱夷子，倒载西施一舸行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":403,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至镇江","author":"谢肃","text":"封事相关入帝京，船临京口敢迟行。\n江流清激金山寺，地势雄盘铁瓮城。\n丹阙翔云双彩凤，青冥披雾两苍鹰。\n仪刑不是忘钦恤，要为天家辅太平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":404,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月十八日天寿圣节","author":"谢肃","text":"黄河清为圣人生，历数从天信有徵。\n尧日辉光龙在御，舜韶和协凤仪庭。\n岁当甲子三正序，秋入乾坤万物成。\n闽海宪臣无补报，但歌天保颂华平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":405,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十一月三日同廉使陶垕仲于奉天门辞再蒙宣谕复职闽宪","author":"谢肃","text":"奉天门下承天语，旷荡天恩讵可酬。\n绣豸巳吞双猛虎，花骢仍接八诸侯。\n每思尽力苏民瘼，终愧无才与国谋。\n海宇太平身健在，闽方虽远足巡游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":406,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复职日闻得子寄乡里诸公","author":"谢肃","text":"海右信来徵吉梦，日边朝退感恩荣。\n织成獬廌衣重着，抱送麒麟子巳生。\n自顾遂良惊白鬓，何烦永叔听秋声。\n使轺若得家山过，乱插䌓花醉一觥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":407,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同陶廉使登钓台","author":"谢肃","text":"南征屡泊桐江船，想像高风洒九天。\n二十八将岂吾侣，一千馀年无尔贤。\n使旆巳承尧日照，钓台难觅客星悬。\n最怜碑碣生苔藓，俯仰云山重慨然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":408,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登南台山","author":"谢肃","text":"南台突兀云上头，长啸俯云曾少留。\n山净九仙骑凤下，江清一女乘螺游。\n烛天剑气发欧冶，隔海岛影衔水流。\n马首还城见新月，更思临眺荔枝楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":409,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒朱文公祠堂","author":"谢肃","text":"太守祠堂倚翠冈，坐间龙象是陈黄。\n草生书带祗园里，树蔚甘棠瘴海阳。\n川岳何年如带砺，墉壕终古似金汤。\n边氓得离干戈苦，一饭犹应祝圣皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":410,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食泉南道中","author":"谢肃","text":"欲发泉南值寒食，一壶聊复饮酴醾。\n莺前榕叶云迎盖，马首梨花雪点衣。\n北顾清凉晴翠积，东临沧海暮潮微。\n人烟簇处长亭在，深念群黎有瘠肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":411,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉山道中","author":"谢肃","text":"一年三过东津桥，千仞碧峰寒玉标。\n古木影随山轿落，早梅香拂使旌飘。\n群氓习俗敦昭代，景佑神灵□□霄。\n此去闽关悬鸟道，长安虽远日非遥。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":412,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳王墓和马令","author":"谢肃","text":"谁把长城自弃捐，不能一马涉中原。\n三军泪湿江南地，二帝䰟飞漠北天。\n幸浙翠华淹日月，和戎綵币转车船。\n几时消得英䧺恨，南拱枝头叫杜鹃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":413,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送行人蔡英夫奉旨颁流求国王印宝就与国王之来享者二人同驾海舟自福建起柁","author":"谢肃","text":"五虎门西叠鼓挝，行人承诏自皇家。\n刻金鸟篆颁王号，建节龙骧戛海霞。\n两国夷君归绝岛，万年天子御中华。\n预知奉使旋京日，浩荡秋涛涌月槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":414,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五月六日先为马蹶而伤左足自清漳千里舆归闽宪是日之夜坐占长句","author":"谢肃","text":"何幸蒙恩不自酬，此心宁敢为身谋。\n塞翁得马未为福，乐子下堂方有忧。\n难把股肱裨帝力，欲冯耳目赞皇猷。\n驰驱未效先成跛，绛烛华轩坐泪流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":415,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五月二十日宪堂清坐怀新湖陈庭豫隐者","author":"谢肃","text":"载见薰风荔子红，忽思往事在眉中。\n神羊曾有畸人梦，骢马真观八郡风。\n雨浥火山垂湛露，云凝炎海崒奇峰。\n眉须雪白无由黑，欲乞还月向魏公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":416,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏荔枝闽宪作","author":"谢肃","text":"星毬朱柿杂硫黄，磊落千林带海旁。\n火齐外包团绛色，水精中结瑩寒浆。\n每嫌天宝供妃子，岂谓元丰献帝王。\n今代御筵唯玉食，不因微物扰炎方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":417,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初入狱","author":"谢肃","text":"两度入闽持宪节，一朝随例赴神京。\n楚囚冠束萧骚发，梁狱书陈恳恻情。\n柙虎有文终自耀，土龙不雨敢言灵。\n寸心俯仰真无愧，唯待宽恩出圣明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":418,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"狱中作","author":"谢肃","text":"闽海归来阙下游，忽从圜土作拘囚。\n文章何用追韩马，义烈徒劳著李刘。\n衰病母妻何所倚，娇痴儿女未知愁。\n苌弘有血终成碧，岁岁春风草际浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":419,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿张知县","author":"谢肃","text":"朱绂南来自帝庭，牛刀宰邑万人宁。\n农耕戴胜鸣桑野，吏散慈乌下讼庭。\n阖境幸沾君子泽，烛天欣睹老人星。\n千年桃发阳春丽，五色芝凝湛露馨。\n好举琼杯餐石髓，仍挥綵笔写丹经。\n汉良辟谷应留诀，唐果修真足引龄。\n东日映云生华彩，南山当户落空青。\n池捎荷雨神龟尾，海拍松风逸鹤翎。\n潋滟兕觥聊上寿，峣峨麟阁会图形。\n由来岂弟常纯嘏，一为哦诗尚可听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":420,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和朱质夫见寄","author":"谢肃","text":"四海初飞战伐尘，栖迟游宦各天真。\n退之偶入淮西幕，子美闲垂汉上纶。\n大道坦夷堪履尾，九霄旷荡莫攀鳞。\n纵归天禄雠青简，何及秋江采绿莼。\n玉櫑具铦祗自惜，黑貂裘弊欲谁纫。\n草仪礼院虽承诏，佐政名州岂若神。\n黍子凉风齐甸阔，桃花流水浙江春。\n画船酒尽馀情在，青鸟书来别恨新。\n万里生还聊尔尔，百年相见好频频。\n玩翁况巳成丘墓，洒泪遥应到海滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":421,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王知县上计朝京","author":"谢肃","text":"封章上计宜居最，奉命朝天在及期。\n帝阙九重环象魏，王春一统发华夷。\n斑联簪笏扬休日，乐听萧韶锡宴时。\n既向枫宸沾圣泽，好归花县慰民思。\n殷勤农父耕田劝，揖逊乡人饮酒仪。\n寡妇何烦孟尝诉，李娥仍诔度公辞。\n淳风百里真堪复，善政三年属有为。\n莫道外官非近侍，钟山咫尺五云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":422,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷伞","author":"谢肃","text":"客行触暑向湖涯，拗得青荷作伞持。\n岛雨乍来珠乱走，浦风飒至扇同挥。\n清香立鹭空思近，圆影游龟竟失依。\n正爱微凉消热恼，敢论高盖带倾危。\n水中好葺湘累室，阵外何妨蜀客衣。\n谁谓脆柔难久恃，自怜芳洁少相知。\n截筒拚饮匏尊尽，屑蒂须将肺病治。\n摧折敷荣吾庇赖，休歌柱镜不堪为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":423,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁未初至南京登凤凰台","author":"谢肃","text":"城上青山合，江中锦浪?。\n纷纷六朝事，独倚凤皇台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":424,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发潍州留别父老","author":"谢肃","text":"赞政既无补，罢官何足多。\n犹烦诸父老，别泪洒银河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":425,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题唐人打毬图","author":"谢肃","text":"惨淡风云地，奔驰汗血驹。\n若非张㒒射，休上击毬书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":426,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题美人图二首 其一","author":"谢肃","text":"睡起向深宫，罗衣立晓风。\n折香聊自嗅，不是妒花容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":427,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题美人图二首 其二","author":"谢肃","text":"绣得鸳鸯似，春窗困思迷。\n闲携玉如意，花底听黄鹂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":428,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏菋莉","author":"谢肃","text":"笑倚薰风浅驻春，生香披拂最撩人。\n晚凉一枕花前梦，曾见霓裳舞太真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":429,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书扇赠黄宗祥","author":"谢肃","text":"薝卜吹香度水阑，石为屏几昼生寒。\n游尘不动沉烟细，自把皇羲易象看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":430,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊萧山","author":"谢肃","text":"来往钱唐涉巨涛，湘湖维舸气犹豪。\n为谁重写登临胜，夺得江家五色毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":431,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题陈敬德主簿棘鹊图","author":"谢肃","text":"棘枝何可着文禽，敛翼卑栖不自禁。\n应待上林春似海，向风飞去弄佳音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":432,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题圯桥老人图","author":"谢肃","text":"处处江山起战尘，谷城犹可著闲身。\n还将天下安危计，都付桥边进履人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":433,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝送沈自成之武康县丞五首 其一","author":"谢肃","text":"杨柳毵毵弄晓晴，柳边持酒送君行。\n春风吹起如簧语，可是啼莺最有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":434,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝送沈自成之武康县丞五首 其二","author":"谢肃","text":"贰令之官别旧游，百花撩乱拥吴州。\n祗应杨柳偏多思，欲把青丝控马头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":435,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝送沈自成之武康县丞五首 其三","author":"谢肃","text":"馆娃宫里柳摇摇，恰似春风舞细腰。\n今日更萦前日恨，送行何惜折长条。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":436,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝送沈自成之武康县丞五首 其四","author":"谢肃","text":"阖闾城外柳飞花，骑马之官驿路斜。\n此去绿阴应满县，风流元不属陶家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":437,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝送沈自成之武康县丞五首 其五","author":"谢肃","text":"吴堤新柳倚晴烟，浅绿轻红最可怜。\n不是多情管离别，要将春色送行船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":438,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝五首 其一","author":"谢肃","text":"南浦春光媚绿波，脩眉轻展似柔蛾。\n若非张绪风流态，敢趁清阴马上过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":439,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝五首 其二","author":"谢肃","text":"记得钱塘折柳枝，画桥流水暮春时。\n苏家小女多才思，一曲翻从笛里吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":440,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝五首 其三","author":"谢肃","text":"吴郡东风柳绕城，朱门华馆总莺声。\n笙歌合奏春阴里，谁念将军灞上营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":441,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝五首 其四","author":"谢肃","text":"何处春来柳树稠，汴河千里接扬州。\n可怜锦䌫巡游后，几度飞花送客舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":442,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳枝五首 其五","author":"谢肃","text":"彭泽归来万事休，更从何处托风流。\n五株杨柳当门种，醉里听莺卧石头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":443,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月七日望西山有作","author":"谢肃","text":"冶剑无因上虎丘，看花有梦过长洲。\n五湖春水如天阔，未许鸱夷放一舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":444,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题孙子庙壁","author":"谢肃","text":"战国干戈格斗时，将军出计最能奇。\n宁羞两足都成断，还揔齐师破魏师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":445,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潍阳闲居二首 其一","author":"谢肃","text":"閒居潍上爱高眠，日晏行庖未起烟。\n不用吏民忧我乏，囊中犹有卖文钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":446,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]